  "goodToKnow": "Die Zielscheibe is a target for shooting or darts, and figuratively a target or butt: die Zielscheibe der Kritik, des Spotts, von Hackerangriffen. Hitting the centre is ins Schwarze treffen (to hit the bull's eye), also figuratively. Shooting clubs (Schützenvereine) and their Schützenfeste are a big tradition in many regions. Die Scheibe means disc, slice or pane. Plural: die Zielscheiben."
